ove his enemy as a kangaroo and drop  onto them as an elephant it could be the  ultimate zone fruit and he would have a  ton of other abilities too to quote  Wukong himself I know how to conceal  myself and vanish I can make spells and  end them I can reach the sky and find my  way to Earth I can travel Under the Sun  or the moon without leaving a shadow or  move through metal and stone freely I  cannot be drowned or burned and there is  nowhere I cannot go I think that the  idea of imagination and freedom that is  so core to Luffy could definitely be  shown through this fruit and while the  idea to fight with a giant stick and a  flying cloud are tempting I think that  might be too similar to Goku so I'm  probably going to avoid them all in all  I think this is a great option for Luffy  to have as an alternate fruit Zorro on  the other hand I think is much more  straightforward we want something to do  with swords blades Buddhism or demons I  think that the obvious one to go for is  Mr one's dice dice fruit turning him  into a living blade and trust me I would  be super tempted to make it some kind of  Akuma mythical fruit but since we just  gave one to Luffy I think that'd be kind  of cheating I can't just make everyone a  mythical devil fruit you know another  option could be baby five's arms fruit  and I mean it could be cool to see Zoro  incorporate a whole host of weapons into  his attacks firing off guns between the  slashes of his swords we could also go  with Eric's sickle sickle fruit to make  his sword swings into long range slices  but I think the fruit that I'm actually  gonna go with is buggies Chop Chop fruit  this fruit would allow Zoro to bring his  three sword style to an entirely new  level by detaching his head and hands to  produce more wild and ranged attacks I'm  gonna be honest though one factor that I  don't particularly really like with this  and you might think it's a good idea is  the fact that the fruit would make Zoro  immune to other b