g into food which is pretty  straightforward as to why a chef might  be able to make good use of that fruit  that said it isn't exactly the most  exciting devil fruit but I'd be  interested to see if Sanji could manage  to make some creative uses for it  especially on the battlefield the fruit  that I actually decided on for Sanji is  aces or the flame flame fruit the fire  abilities that this could provide would  couple pretty well with sanji's Diablo  Jean and on top of that we could add  some jet-like propulsion to his kicks or  jumps similar to the effect of the  spring spring fruit would have had this  would also give him access to flames and  heat and fits with the idea of him being  a chef and cooking things as well I know  people probably won't like the idea of  Sanji getting Ace's fruit but I think it  fits most aspects of his character  really well and even thematically Flames  are supposed to be about passion and  that's like kind of sanji's big thing on  to Nami though and we have a few traits  that we can play off we have Nami being  a cat burglar loving money using her  femininity as well as being a navigator  and someone who's proficient in reading  the weather there are definitely plenty  of choices here if this was much earlier  in the series I think the clear clear  fruit could have been really cool for  allowing Nami to sneak around invisibly  which could definitely have been a very  cool idea as far as loving money the  gold gold fruit is an option but I don't  really think it fits her much so we can  just move past that one what would be a  very interesting option though is BOA  Hancock's love love fruit just like boa  Nami often uses her sexuality to her  advantage and even for Laughs from time  to time with things like the happiness  punch it's a choice that I think could  have been very fun but I think for Nami  the best option would be for her to  focus on weather and navigation based  abilities Monet's snow fruit or annel's  Rumble Rumble f