ices  whisper whisper fruit which allowed them  to speak to animals this kind of Keeps  The Animal theme in play which I think  is a pretty good way of doing things but  there's also the doctor wrote and I  don't want him to have laws of a off  they know me I don't think think that  suits Chopper at all at least the room  aspect of it is very strange so maybe  like Nami we could give him a  watered-down version of someone else's  powerful fruit a medic medic fruit or a  nurse nurse fruit which wouldn't give  him any of the room abilities but would  specifically boost up the healing  capabilities of Law's fruit between that  and the whisper whisper I think we could  have some pretty good choices for  Chopper Robin was probably the one I was  most excited for on this list and that's  for a few reasons while I love the Hana  hananomi or the bloom bloom fruit that  she already has it doesn't exactly  supplement her character this fruit  allows her to sprout body parts on any  nearby surface from walls to people's  backs as long as it's solid she can  Sprout hands legs or even an entire  clone of herself there Robin can also  make amalgams of her limbs to produce  giant forms of them or to give herself  wings that allow her to fly for a few  moments something that I really liked  that was introduced Post Time skipped is  that she can even Infuse these attacks  with the basics of Fishman karate which  she learned while she was with the  revolutionaries finally Robin's newest  ability was shown off in her fight with  black Maria we see her using demon  blooming an attack where she grows a  giant upper body with extra parts like  wings fangs and horns to look like a  devil and that part is pretty fitting  considering the devil child epithet but  like I said the fruit as a whole just  doesn't fit in super thematically with  Robin outside of the idea of keeping  people at arm's length which to her has  a whole new meaning so what other  aspects of her character could we focus