e the Yamato access to  fangs Claws and a pretty massive boost  to her strength and speed on top of that  as it's a mythical Zone it also gives  her a special ability in this case being  able to produce ice or even shoot blasts  of it through her mouth it's an  incredibly cool fruit but I do think I  have some interesting alternative ideas  Yamato lived her life In Chains held  captive under kaido so I think taking  that struggle and turning it into her  strength would be very poetic in a  beautiful way giving Yamato hira's cage  cage fruits or mad Treasures chain chain  fruit could be a genuinely cool way to  turn her past trauma into a physically  manifested strength locking her  opponents down like she had been for so  long and bolstering her own strength to  overcome them I already really love the  fruit that Yamato has so it was kind of  hard to think of a new one for her but  if she had to get something else I think  that these could be really interesting  ones for her to deal with and that's all  of them this was a surprisingly  difficult list to make but I think that  the fruits we came up with were very  thematically fitting at the very least  while still being very fun and exciting  let me know what you guys think though  do you like my choices for alternate  fruits or do you think that other fruits  could have fit better with these  characters or do you prefer the  originals and if so which original Fruit  is your favorite tell us what you think  and while you're down there remember to  leave a like to show support in this  video and to tell us that you want more  one-piece content you can also subscribe  to the channel so you make sure you  never miss any of the great content  coming your way if you're looking to  support me personally you can always  check out my own channel axle beats I  have a Dragon Ball video coming out  fairly soon and of course a massive  thank you to Opera GX for sponsoring  this video be sure to check them out in  the description down below but for now  thank you all so much for watching and  until next time remember to stay  excellent
 

